    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$1120.72$ annually.",
      "worked": "For 7 annual periods at 8% per period, the table gives a future-value factor of $8.9228$. Let $M$ be the annual contribution.\n$$\\begin{align*}10\\,000 &= 8.9228M\\\\M &= \\frac{10\\,000}{8.9228}\\\\M &\\approx \\$1120.72\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
